---
layout: base.njk
ogType: article
current: blog
---
{%- set canonical = page.url | absUrl -%}
<article class="post"><div class="post-wrap">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="현재 위치"><a href="/">홈</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/blog/">블로그</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/blog/category/{{ categoryKey }}/">{{ categoryLabel }}</a></nav>
  <a class="post-cat" href="/blog/category/{{ categoryKey }}/">{{ categoryLabel }}</a>
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ page.date | dateISO }}">{{ page.date | dateKR }}</time>{% if updated %}<span>{{ updated | dateKR }} 수정</span>{% endif %}<span>읽는 데 약 {{ content | readingMinutes }}분</span></div>
  {%- if image %}
  <figure class="post-cover"><img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ coverAlt }}" fetchpriority="high"></figure>
  {%- endif %}
  <div class="prose">
{{ content | postHtml | safe }}
  </div>
  {%- if postTags.length %}
  <ul class="tags" aria-label="태그">{% for t in postTags %}<li>#{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  {%- endif %}
  <div class="post-tools">
    <a class="btn btn-line" href="/blog/">목록으로</a>
    <button class="btn btn-line" type="button" data-copy-url="{{ canonical }}">글 주소 복사</button>
  </div>
  <aside class="post-cta">
    <div>
      <h2>우리 공간에도 놓을 수 있을까요?</h2>
      <p>설치 장소와 판매할 상품을 알려주시면 맞는 구성을 제안해 드려요.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn btn-call" href="tel:{{ site.tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/#contact">문의 남기기</a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div></article>
{%- set related = collections.blogPosts | relatedPosts(page.url, categoryKey) %}
{%- if related.length %}
<section class="related section--white"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>함께 읽으면 좋은 글</h2>
  <ul class="post-grid">
    {%- for p in related %}{% include "post-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div></section>
{%- endif %}
